---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Vote from '../components/Vote.astro';
import {projects,contributors,activity} from '../lib/data';
import {WEIGHTS} from '../lib/scoring.mjs';
const people=[...contributors].sort((a,b)=>b.points-a.points||a.login.localeCompare(b.login));
const prs=people.reduce((n,p)=>n+p.prs.length,0);
---
<Base title="Useful software, built together" description="Explore AppKade's open-source projects. Use the tools, improve the code, and build something useful together on GitHub.">
<section class="hero shell" aria-labelledby="intro"><div class="hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow"><span class="live-dot"></span> THE OPEN SIDE OF APPKADE</p><h1 id="intro">Useful software.<br/><span>Built together.</span></h1><p class="intro">Open-source tools from AppKade. Explore the code, make it your own, or help us make it better.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button" href="#projects">Explore projects <span aria-hidden="true">↘</span></a><a class="text-link" href="#contribute">Make your first contribution <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div><p class="hero-note">Public code. Open collaboration. Everyone welcome.</p></div><div class="hero-art" aria-hidden="true"><div class="orbit orbit-one"></div><div class="orbit orbit-two"></div><div class="art-mark"><img src="/favicon.svg" width="140" height="140" alt=""/></div><span class="art-caption">IDEAS → CODE → SOMETHING USEFUL</span><span class="orbit-dot"></span></div></section>
<section class="shell section" id="projects" aria-labelledby="projects-heading"><div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">01 / EXPLORE</p><h2 id="projects-heading">Find something useful.</h2><p>Tools you can use, inspect, and improve.</p></div><span class="section-count">{projects.length} public project{projects.length===1?'':'s'}</span></div><div class="projects">{projects.map((project,index)=><article class="project" id={`project-${project.slug}`}><div class="project-main"><div class="project-meta"><span class="project-number">{String(index+1).padStart(2,'0')}</span><span>{project.category}</span><span class="status-tag">{project.status}</span></div><h3>{project.name}</h3><p class="project-description">{project.description}</p><ul class="tags" aria-label="Technologies"><li>{project.language}</li>{project.tags.map(tag=><li>{tag}</li>)}</ul><div class="actions"><a class="button secondary" href={`https://github.com/${project.repo}`}>View repository ↗</a><a class="text-link" href={`https://github.com/${project.repo}/issues`}>Open issues ↗</a></div></div><div class="project-side"><p class="eyebrow">GET INVOLVED</p><p>Found a bug? Have a better idea?<br/>Start a conversation on GitHub.</p><a class="text-link" href={`https://github.com/${project.repo}/issues/new`}>Suggest an improvement ↗</a><details class="setup"><summary>Run it locally <span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><pre><code>{project.installation}</code></pre><a href={`https://github.com/${project.repo}#readme`}>Full setup instructions ↗</a></details><details class="interest"><summary>Show your interest <span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>Votes show community interest and do not affect contributor points.</p><Vote project={project}/></details></div></article>)}</div>{!projects.length&&<p class="empty">Our first projects are on their way. <a href="https://github.com/AppKade">Explore GitHub ↗</a></p>}</section>
<section class="section shell" id="contribute" aria-labelledby="contribute-heading"><div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">02 / CONTRIBUTE</p><h2 id="contribute-heading">Small changes count.</h2><p>A clearer sentence, a bug fix, a useful feature. Start where you can.</p></div><a class="text-link" href="https://github.com/AppKade/open/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md">Contribution guide ↗</a></div><div class="steps"><article><span>01</span><h3>Choose a project</h3><p>Read its README and browse open issues. For larger changes, discuss the idea with a maintainer first.</p></article><article><span>02</span><h3>Make a focused change</h3><p>Follow the repository's setup instructions, test your change, and open a pull request for review.</p></article><article><span>03</span><h3>Build your track record</h3><p>Eligible merged pull requests appear in the next GitHub sync, with a link back to your work.</p></article></div><details class="policy"><summary>How contribution points and recognition work <span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><div class="policy-content"><p>Points come from merged PRs on registered public AppKade repositories. No AppKade account is required. Stars, followers, and project votes do not earn points.</p><ul class="score-list">{Object.entries(WEIGHTS).map(([type,points])=><li><span>{type}</span><strong>{points} pts</strong></li>)}<li><span>First eligible PR bonus</span><strong>+5 pts</strong></li></ul><p>Each PR has one primary classification, based on maintainer labels. Badges recognise 1, 3, and 10 eligible PRs. Spam, duplicate, fraudulent, and artificially split contributions may be excluded after review. Recognition is not a professional endorsement.</p><a href="https://github.com/AppKade/open/blob/main/docs/recognition.md">Full recognition policy ↗</a></div></details></section>
<section class="section shell" id="community" aria-labelledby="community-heading"><div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">03 / COMMUNITY</p><h2 id="community-heading">The people behind the code.</h2><p>{prs?`${prs} merged pull requests. Every contribution links back to GitHub.`:'A new community starts with a first contribution. Yours could be next.'}</p></div></div><div class="community-grid"><div class="community-panel"><div class="panel-heading"><h3>Contributors</h3><span>All time</span></div>{people.length?<ol class="contributors">{people.map(person=><li><a href={`https://github.com/${person.login}`} class="person">{person.avatarUrl&&<img src={person.avatarUrl} alt="" width="38" height="38" loading="lazy"/>}<span><strong>@{person.login}</strong><small>{person.prs.length} merged PR{person.prs.length===1?'':'s'}</small></span><b>{person.points}<small>points</small></b></a><details class="person-history"><summary>View contributions</summary><ul>{person.prs.map(pr=><li><a href={pr.url}>{pr.title} ↗</a><small>+{pr.points} pts · {pr.mergedAt.slice(0,10)}</small></li>)}</ul></details></li>)}</ol>:<p class="empty">Room for the first builders.<br/><a href="#projects">Find a project to contribute to →</a></p>}</div><div class="community-panel"><div class="panel-heading"><h3>Recently merged</h3><a href="https://github.com/AppKade/open/pulls?q=is%3Apr+is%3Amerged">GitHub ↗</a></div>{activity.items.length?<ul class="activity">{activity.items.slice(0,4).map(item=><li><span class="merge-icon" aria-hidden="true">↳</span><div><a href={item.url}>{item.title} ↗</a><small>@{item.login} · {item.mergedAt.slice(0,10)}</small></div></li>)}</ul>:<p class="empty">Merged contributions will appear here after the next successful sync.</p>}</div></div><div class="community-foot"><p>{activity.generatedAt?`Last sync: ${activity.generatedAt.slice(0,10)} (UTC)`:'Contribution data is synced from GitHub.'}{activity.syncStatus==='failed'&&' · Latest sync unavailable; showing the previous snapshot.'}</p><a href="https://github.com/AppKade/open/issues">Request a correction or opt out ↗</a></div></section>
</Base>
<script src="https://challenges.cloudflare.com/turnstile/v0/api.js?render=explicit" defer></script>
